  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre for Human Rights, 2017-2021, Support to Strategic plan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Centre for Human Rights, st&#xf6;d till strategisk plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Finansiellt st&#xf6;d och samarbete med The Human Rights Center vid Addis Abeba Universitet i syfte att st&#xe4;rka utbildning och forsking inom omr&#xe5;det m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter. Samarbete mellan Raoul Wallenberg Institute (RWI) och AAU-CHR, inom CHR utbildning, juridisk hj&#xe4;lp och forsking</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Centre for Human Rights at the Addis Abeba University and its Strategic Plan 2016-20. The support is made in collaboration with Norway.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed interventions goal is to contribute to the long term goal of ensuring respect for the human rights of all Ethiopians.

The activities under this Sub-Project focus mainly on the academic programs of CHR and are aimed to:
1.Design and launch new multidisciplinary post graduate level academic programs on any two issues such as on child rights and protection, on good governance and human rights, on migration, and other fields of multidisciplinary studies in human rights;
2.Strengthen CHRs capabilities of delivering multidisciplinary programs in human rights education through the production of pertinent textbooks and manuals;
3.Organize short term training courses on various human rights issues focused on the strategic thematic areas targeting high and mid-level government and civil society leaders and officials.</narrative>
  </description>
